==Description==
The '''MeltingIce Nametag''' is a nametag that could be obtained at Level 29 of the regular [[Operation I.C.E Event#Operation I.C.E Event Battle Pass|Operation I.C.E Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it costed {{Bell|980}} or {{Robux|88}} to unlock it, with a total cost of {{Bell|13,490}} or {{Robux|2,840}}. It was also obtained through the [[Ducky Revenge Event#Ducky Revenge Battle Pass|Ducky Revenge Battle Pass]] due to bugs at the same Level for an identical event currency and robux cost, though this was fixed and it has been replaced by the [[GlitterBomb Nametag]].

The '''MeltingIce Nametag''' has light blue text with a blue translucent outline. The text is inside a piece of translucent ice, which is melting, with water coming down from it.

